@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

title Codex Development Workflow — Authorized Full Delivery Overview

start
:Requirement;
note right
  Ordinary requests route directly to the owning stage.
  This complete path requires explicit end-to-end authorization.
end note
:plan-workflow;
:develop-workflow;
:verify-workflow;
:State / Docs if changed;
:publish-workflow;
note right
  Publish only the authorized batch;
  stop at the selected commit / push / PR boundary.
end note
:integrate-workflow;
:Validate merged State / Docs;
:Evaluate / follow-up;
note right
  Report evidence-backed improvement for user decision.
  Follow-up work requires a new request.
end note
stop
@enduml
